<template id="manual-methods-template">
  <section class="manual-methods-desk" aria-labelledby="manual-methods-title">
    <div class="admin-content-heading"><div><span class="section-kicker">MONEY IN. MONEY OUT. / MANUAL METHODS</span><h2 id="manual-methods-title">More ways to move<span>.</span></h2><p>Add your payment image, name and instructions. Choose where each method is available.</p></div><button type="button" class="button green" id="manual-method-new">Add payment method ↗</button></div>
    <p class="manual-catalog-note">Once you add a method, this list controls manual deposits and withdrawals. The original bank settings apply until then. Disable a method to stop new requests; pending requests retain their original details.</p>
    <div class="manual-method-toolbar"><span id="manual-method-count"></span><button type="button" class="button outline" id="manual-method-refresh">Refresh methods ↻</button></div>
    <p id="manual-method-message" class="form-error" role="status" hidden></p>
    <div id="manual-method-list" class="manual-method-grid"></div>
  </section>
</template>
<div id="manual-method-dialog" class="manual-method-backdrop" hidden><section class="manual-method-dialog" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="manual-method-dialog-title"><button type="button" class="icon-button manual-method-close" data-manual-close aria-label="Close payment method editor">×</button><span class="section-kicker">YOUR PAYMENT CHANNELS / MANUAL REVIEW</span><h2 id="manual-method-dialog-title">Create a method<span>.</span></h2><p class="manual-catalog-note">Describe how users should pay or receive funds. Withdrawal fields collect the recipient details your team needs for a payout.</p><form id="manual-method-form" autocomplete="off"><div class="admin-form-grid"><label class="admin-field"><span>Payment method name</span><input name="name" required maxlength="80" placeholder="For example, bank transfer or mobile money"></label><label class="admin-field"><span>Method image <small>(JPG, PNG or WebP · up to 1 MB)</small></span><input name="image" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp" required><img id="manual-method-preview" class="manual-method-preview" alt="Payment method image preview" hidden></label></div><label class="admin-field"><span>Payment details and instructions</span><textarea name="instructions" required maxlength="3000" rows="4" placeholder="Deposit destination, account details, payment network, fees, or withdrawal instructions"></textarea></label><div class="manual-method-toggles"><label><input name="enabled" type="checkbox" checked> Enabled</label><label><input name="deposit_enabled" type="checkbox" checked> Deposits</label><label><input name="withdrawal_enabled" type="checkbox"> Withdrawals</label></div><section class="manual-fields-builder" aria-labelledby="manual-fields-title"><div class="manual-fields-heading"><div><h3 id="manual-fields-title">Withdrawal details</h3><p>Users complete these fields when requesting a withdrawal. Never request passwords, PINs, card security codes or seed phrases.</p></div><button type="button" class="button outline" id="manual-field-add">Add field +</button></div><div id="manual-fields-list"></div></section><label class="admin-field"><span>Your current administrator password</span><input name="current_password" type="password" required maxlength="128" autocomplete="current-password"></label><p id="manual-method-save-error" class="form-error" role="alert" hidden></p><div class="manual-method-actions"><button type="button" class="button outline" data-manual-close>Cancel</button><button type="submit" class="button green" id="manual-method-save">Save payment method ↗</button></div></form></section></div>
